### Login 
POST http://localhost:81/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@admin.com.br",
    "password": "123456789"
}

### Logout 
GET http://localhost:81/api/auth/logout


